OL,3,GNEWSAViews sought on town's #65m
OL,4,Amultiversity plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in Blackpool are being asked
OL,7,Fwhat they think about a #65m college
OL,8,Fcampus being built in the town centre.
OL,10,FThe multiversity, near Blackpool North
OL,11,Frailway station, will be expected to
OL,12,Fbring about 3,000 students, apprentices
OL,13,Fand staff into the town centre when it
OL,14,Fopens in September 2028.
OL,16,FBlackpool and The Fylde College said
OL,17,Fthe development would aim to make
OL,18,Fhigher education more accessible and
OL,19,Fhelp people gain skills and
OL,20,Fqualifications.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
